--------------------------------------------------------------------
libftdi version 1.5
--------------------------------------------------------------------

libftdi - A library (using libusb) to talk to FTDI's UART/FIFO chips
including the popular bitbang mode.

This repository is a fork of libftdi from www.intra2net.com. It contains specific changes needed for the use with the blackmagic-debug project.

As the whole blackmagic-debug project has moved to [codeberg](https://codeberg.org/blackmagic-debug/libftdi) this repository with the necessary changes is now also maintained on codeberg.
